    "faqVpnA": "Yes. Self-host has no external dependencies (S3, Jira, Slack, Google Sheets are all optional). Run docker compose on a single VM and you're done.",
    "faqPrivacyQ": "What about data privacy?",
    "faqPrivacyA": "The SDK captures DOM and CDP events from the pages you opt into. Self-host means the data never leaves your servers. The hosted plan will include DPA, EU data residency, and per-org isolation."
